@startuml state_link_recovery
title Plugin link supervisor (background thread)

[*] --> Searching : scene start, initial discovery found nothing
[*] --> Up : scene start, discovery found the board

state Up : bytes arrive from the board\nControlPackets are applied
state Searching : close the old port\nwait RetryIntervalMs (2000 ms)\npick the next candidate
state Handshaking : open with DtrEnable = true\nsettle 300 ms\nsend 0, 1, 2, 3\nwait up to 1500 ms for 3, 1, 4

Up --> Searching : lost: writer reported LinkFailed\nor no bytes for LinkTimeoutMs (3000 ms)\nor port closed or throwing
Searching --> Handshaking : candidate port opened\n(last known port first,\nthen every non-Bluetooth port)
Searching --> Searching : open failed\n(next candidate, next attempt)
Handshaking --> Searching : no handshake reply\n(close, try the next candidate)
Handshaking --> Up : reply 3, 1, 4\n(reconnected, no scene reload)
Searching --> [*] : leaving the flight scene
Up --> [*] : leaving the flight scene
@enduml
